# AI Computer use agent

This is a TAURI v2 App.

Documentation:
https://v2.tauri.

We have this A.I. Anthropic Computer Use Bot.
We want it to have a complete implementation. Some of the computer use  functions are stubbed in.
Find any incomplete functions in the Mac platform, Also make sure that you research anthropic computer use and look to see if we're missing anything completely.

After every code modification made to Rust files, run `cargo check --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml`. Ensure the command completes successfully (exit code 0). If `cargo check` fails, address the reported errors or warnings.